    &gt;Exploiting XXE to retrieve files&lt;/a&gt;, where an external entity is defined containing the contents of a file, and returned in the application&amp;rsquo;s response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;solution&#34;&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#solution&#34; class=&#34;header-anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
