    Finding the vulnerability
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Based on the lab description, our objective is to inject an XML external entity in order to retrieve the contents of the &lt;code&gt;/etc/passwd&lt;/code&gt; file.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
